current_browser_first_local_consent_release:
  deployment_id: 20260715T042636Z
  production_status: pass
  browser_default: Browser chat makes no startup request to a desktop program or loopback service.
  companion_boundary: The optional desktop companion is contacted only after the user chooses Connect desktop companion and sees the pre-access explanation.
  local_memory_boundary: A local UAIX Memory Deck remains the offline memory-context option; locally queued synchronization remains available for delivery after reconnection.
  worldwide_memory_boundary: MemoryEndpoints.com is optional and encouraged for worldwide, cross-browser, and cross-device continuity; new hosted reads, writes, and synchronization require internet.
  live_browser_evidence: artifacts/reports/tinyrustlm-live-browser-local-consent-2026-07-15.json
  live_browser_evidence_sha256: 80e1d27e46ee49499be38eced4f6faaa3eee029ba41409c2ea0f1a32d059fb74
